7: All agents execute action  \( a(t) = \{a_{1}(t), a_{2}(t), \ldots, a_{L}(t)\} \)  and observe rewards  \( r(t) = \{r_{1}(t), r_{2}(t), \ldots, r_{L}(t)\} \) , and the new state  \( s_{l}(t + 1) \sim s_{l}' \) 
